# Bile-Vial Boggart {B} 1/1: "When this creature dies, put a -1/-1 counter on up to one target creature." Bot1 kills its own Boggart with
# Blight Rot (four counters, so it dies as a -3/-3; CR 704.5f) and the death trigger puts exactly one counter on Bot2's Wall of Earth
# (0/6 becomes -1/5). The counter goes on the creature chosen, not on the Boggart's killer. The twin that chooses nobody is
# "...-with-no-target-chosen-puts-no-counter".

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Bile-Vial Boggart
Blight Rot
Island x4
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Wall of Earth
Island x17

